---

This project is a port of Gotify server (https://github.com/gotify/server),
which is also MIT licensed (Copyright (c) 2018 jmattheis; the web UI in its
ui/ directory is part of the same repository and licence).

Its behaviour, API, and parts of its logic (including error messages, routing
and the authentication rules) are taken from Gotify. The fractional indexing in
src/fracdex.ts follows rocicorp/fracdex (CC0-1.0), which Gotify includes as
its fracdex package.
